%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: DioniseIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: New here? Good. I prefer a checkpoint where the officer still pays
      attention. Dionise Chkonia, professor of philosophy.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: I've been teaching ethics since things escalated. I'm also coming
      from the archive today. There are texts worth saving before the dust gets worse.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: What kind of texts?
      npcResponse: Primary sources. First editions that exist nowhere else. I won't
        let the next one disappear.
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    - playerChoiceText: Is the dust getting worse?
      npcResponse: Yes. I don't think we're getting the full picture. I stopped
        waiting for one.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookDown
  - type: 0
    npcLine: My students are anxious. When the world destabilizes, people look
      for structure. I keep my lectures on schedule. Routine is its own reassurance.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: I have a wife and two children at home. We're managing. My papers
      are current, I check them every two weeks.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: How are your children holding up?
      npcResponse: Children adapt. What frightens them is watching us pretend we
        aren't. So I stopped pretending.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookDown
    - playerChoiceText: You seem very calm about all of this.
      npcResponse: Stoicism. It's the only rational response to what you can't
        control.
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
